           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core_quarantine[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core_quarantine: add a sase-core module that quarantines confirmed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ACE-run dirs into a journaled, restorable trash by atomic rename, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]re-checking every protection first. It also lists, restores, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]protection-verifies purges, with PyO3 bindings and tests. The unattended[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]apply refusal stays.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Python facade, review snapshots, and CLI apply/restore[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]trash_callers[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core_quarantine[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]trash_callers: ratchet the core pin, add the Python facade and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]review-snapshot payload module, make `prune-runs --apply` quarantine [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fresh-intersect-reviewed runs, and post a result notification. `artifact[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]trash` gains run batches, and the artifact index stays consistent.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Hourly preview emits an actionable, beautiful notification[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]preview_notification[dim] · [dim][/dim]after trash_callers[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]preview_notification: the chop purges expired batches, writes a review [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]snapshot, and attaches the review payload. It redesigns the report with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]project display names and per-project rows, supersedes stale previews, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and drops the \"preview-only\" copy.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]TUI prune review modal behind notification Enter[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]review_modal[dim] · [dim][/dim]after trash_callers, preview_notification[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]review_modal: route Enter on payload-bearing report notifications to a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]new prune review modal with ready, blocked, missing, and running states.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]On confirm it submits the CLI apply as a durable proc and reports [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]completion. Includes badges, footer, help, visual snapshots, and an [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]end-to-end fixture test.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-1rd","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-1rd.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-bd7a693ae8ec0c40675c610f871e2234","started_at":"2026-11-05T11:23:12.478883+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1793891651,"sha":"37a4c8ed8d2b30942697494d1624532a63434460","subject":"feat(artifact): quarantine ACE runs to restorable trash with review snapshots"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"adb6a789443ec009a2ca32bb450f125a6d8e9810480a79527713420ef2cdccc0","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1rd.2--1/chat.md","size_bytes":16010},"commits":{"digest":"6316ec78df8702cdbac4e6ac5f504f497eaf9d5f7ae57f6e7748122319feb89c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1rd.2--1/commits.json","size_bytes":255},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"8d6917a45b8cddaec7042b57dc4d81c5d9d496f3c7dac1959294562410d325fd","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1rd.2--1/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":65},"meta":{"digest":"cdd0c5de360c1f2f97535c8e5720ca9d42f1f7c1883e87ef94d666cc2b59a58e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1rd.2--1/meta.json","size_bytes":651},"prompt":{"digest":"f8974bfbc41c576f19cb7c2cf6ecc617b07840948dd38614ef4a5fd54bff60b2","path":"agents/bbugyi